      "content": "i get that, but i'm not really looking to go to the doctor tonight, i just need to sleep lol. it's really just one glass of wine, not like i'm getting drunk. i've read that a little bit of alcohol helps some people sleep better. surely a tiny bit won't actually cause breathing problems or anything crazy like that? i just want to know if it's actually unsafe or if people just overreact to it.",
