      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i hear you, but you're saying it could cause seizures or something from just one glass? that sounds a bit extreme tbh. i'm a pretty big person and i have a high tolerance for wine, so i don't think a tiny bit is gonna hit me that hard. are you sure there's no safe way to do it? like if i wait an hour after the wine before taking the pill, or if i just take a half dose of the ambien instead? i really just need to know if there's any way to make this work so i can sleep.",
